  "$comment": "CHANWE brand tokens. This file is the source: tokens.css and tokens.scss are generated from it (npm run brand:tokens). Seeded on 2026-10-01 from chanwe-brand _extensions/chanwe-brand/brand.yml, aliases resolved. Body font moved from Inter to Satoshi on 2026-10-01: Satoshi everywhere (apps, Odoo, PDrive, documents, emails), Schibsted Grotesk for display, JetBrains Mono for labels. Inter left the body stack on 2026-10-08 (kit 0.25.0). Violet added on 2026-10-07 (kit 0.18.0) for the Reports tone: #7C3AED is the palette's code-number violet (5.7:1 on white, so it holds text), violet-soft its 12% wash on white, the pair read like status-info / status-info-bg. color.dark (0.42.0): the dark theme's values of the neutral palette entries; an entry not listed keeps its light value in the dark theme (the orange, the pure black and white, the chart colours). ink-light and ink-soft stay obsidian: they are surfaces, not text. Campo y Señal (kit 0.82.0, 2026-10-19): the motion family (four eases, five durations) and the hair and window radii, so the effects, the kit, the website, the sign-in and the desktop read one set. canvas and pane added on 2026-10-27 (kit 0.85.0, the Radar language): canvas is the ground the shell paints (#E9EEF4 light, #232A35 dark, the lighter obsidian) and pane the glass surfaces over it (white, #111319 dark); paper and surface-raised keep their values for documents and components. Radii pane 12 / row 8 / pill 999 for the shell, panes, rows and pills. CHANWE v2 (kit 0.93.0, 2026-10-29, brand/guidelines/brand-v2.md): radii surface 16 (panes on a canvas page) and band 24 (obsidian bands, large panels), and the depth group: the shadows rest / lift / overlay, the top sheen and edge, the tint and the glass blur, light and dark, so chanwe.ar, emails and Odoo read the depth the kit draws.",
